  m_Name: Evento_FraturaDigital
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Fratura Digital
  _titleEn: Digital Divide
  _category: 1
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Quando os servi\xE7os passam para a internet, quem n\xE3o tem acesso
    ou n\xE3o sabe usar fica de fora."
  _summaryEn: When services move online, people without access or skills are left
    out.
  _realWorld: "A pesquisa TIC Domic\xEDlios, do Cetic.br, mede todo ano quem usa
    a internet no Brasil e mostra diferen\xE7as por renda, idade e regi\xE3o."
  _realWorldEn: "The TIC Domic\xEDlios survey by Cetic.br measures internet use in
    Brazil every year and shows gaps by income, age and region."
  _tradeOffs: "Manter atendimento presencial, oferecer acesso p\xFAblico e ensinar
    a usar a tecnologia evita excluir parte da popula\xE7\xE3o."
  _tradeOffsEn: Keeping in-person service, offering public access and teaching people
    to use technology avoids excluding part of the population.
  _sources:
  - Label: "Cetic.br, TIC Domic\xEDlios"
    Url: https://cetic.br/pt/pesquisa/domicilios/
